# Keep the deployment small, but never exclude anything the service needs to
# run. An earlier version of this file excluded *.json and *.npz, which would
# have shipped the application without its three data artifacts and without
# the model weights -- a deployment that starts cleanly and answers every
# data request with 503.
*.docx
*.pdf
_archive/
tests/
.github/
requirements-dev.txt

# Documentation, except the one page a visitor lands on.
*.md
!README.md
